1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,057
Offered whatever the family will not take, Runtu chooses two tables, four chairs, a balance, the ashes from the stove for his fields, and an incense burner with candlesticks.

2
00:00:12,057 --> 00:00:13,828
Remember those candlesticks.

3
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:18,437
The narrator smiles at them now, and will turn the joke on himself at the end.

